      "heading": "The Confined Spaces Regulations 1997",
      "html": "<p>Entry to a confined space is controlled under the Confined Spaces Regulations 1997. Avoid entry if you can. If you cannot, use a safe system of work with emergency cover. The permit records the air test, isolation, ventilation, rescue plan, and the named entrant and attendant.</p><p>Quickler records each one as the permit is raised, with photos of the isolation and the readings from the calibrated monitor. It is not a gas detector. It does not authorise entry. A competent person does.</p>"
    },
