      "html": "<p><strong>Hot work.</strong> Welding, cutting and grinding near things that burn need a fire watch, fuel isolated and a check of the area after. The permit records the watch time and the final check.</p><p><strong>Electrical isolation.</strong> Isolate, prove dead and lock off. The permit records who did each step.</p><p><strong>Work at height.</strong> Under the Work at Height Regulations 2005 you plan, use competent people and pick the right access. The permit records the access method, the equipment check and the fall protection.</p>"
